#: admin/class-fupi-admin.php:707
msgid "WP Full Picture could not update its settings after three attempts. Public WP Full Picture functionality is disabled and page caching has resumed. Tracking tools loaded independently of WP Full Picture are no longered managed by the built-in Consent Management tool."
