msgid "WP Full Picture will modify Pixel code to comply with the data processing regulations in Colorado, Connecticut and California (US). This will negatively impact data accuracy, campaign performance and retargeting done on the visitors from these states. Users from other states and countries will not be affected. %1$sLearn more%2$s."
